// GCP Service Account Key Created
// Detects a user-managed key being created for a service account. A downloaded key is a long-lived credential that works from anywhere and survives the password reset that ends most incidents.
// techniques: T1098.001   severity: medium   status: experimental
// validate: Atomic Red Team T1098.001
//   gcloud iam service-accounts keys create /tmp/k.json --iam-account=<lab-sa>@<project>.iam.gserviceaccount.com
// source: rules/persistence/gcp-service-account-key-created.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
GCPAuditLogs
| where ((MethodName =~ @"google.iam.admin.v1.CreateServiceAccountKey"))
